{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はメンバーみんなで\n初詣行ってきた〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定の乃木神社！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お祓いしてもらってる時の\nお経みたいなやつ\n何言ってるかよくわかんなかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46とか\nヒットとか言ってたのはわかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/01/09/5915465/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいい年になりそうだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思った矢先"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじ引いたら\n小吉だって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜む(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番反応に困るやーつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で\nおみくじに書いてあること読んでたら\nいろいろ不安になってきたよ(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸能は良いことなさそうな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"転職したら良さそうな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やめてくれよ(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶然友達と会うなんて地元だったの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n新宿で会ったよ〜！\n地元の学校じゃなかったから\n地元では会わない(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季のドラマはなに見る？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n隠蔽捜査\n失恋ショコラティエ\nダークシステム 恋の王座決定戦\n恋文日和\n福家警部補の挨拶\nチーム・バチスタ4 螺鈿迷宮\n僕のいた時間\n明日、ママがいない\n鼠、江戸を疾る\n緊急取調室\nDr.DMAT\n医龍4\n慰謝料弁護士\n闇金ウシジマくん Season2\n夜のせんせい\n私の嫌いな探偵\nなぞの転校生\nウレロ☆未体験少女\n戦力外捜査官\nロストデイズ\n大東京トイボックス\nSHARK\nS-最後の警官-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の予定！\nこの質問は安定だね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西暦はわかるんだけど\n平成何年か聞かれたらいつも悩むんだよなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーて\n前に元旦のブログで西暦間違えたっけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、あれ\n2年前か！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついこないだくらいの感覚"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/01/09/5915465/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/01/09/5915465/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきロック画面の画像変えた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}